Type: Package
Package: soundmeteR
Title: R package for sound meter alike analysis
Version: 0.2.0.9003
Author: Cássio Rachid Simões, Shaka Nóbrega Marinho Furtado, Ingrid Maria Denóbile Torres, Marcelo Felgueiras Napoli and Carlos Barros de Araújo
Maintainer: Cássio Rachid Simões <cassiorachid@gmail.com>
Description: An R package for sound analysis using octave and one-third octave spectral analysis, with calibration support for obtaining Sound Pressure Level (SPL) and Sound Intensity Level (SIL).
URL: https://github.com/ConservaSom/soundmeteR
BugReports: https://github.com/ConservaSom/soundmeteR/issues
License: GPL (>=3)
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), tuneR, seewave, dplyr, progress
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: TRUE
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
